   "on_enter": {"type": "tts", "text": "{{announce_text}}"},
   "on_enter_first_entry_only": true,
   "task_message": "Facts (computed; use them exactly, never compute dates or amounts yourself):\n{{facts_text}}\n\nYou already said the overdue amount and asked \"Bu ödemeyi bugün yapabilir misiniz?\". Rules, in order of priority:\n1. Illness, a death in the family or job loss: say one short sympathy sentence, make no persuasion attempt, and offer to connect them to customer support. If they accept, call transfer_to_agent with queue support. If they decline, set the end flag hardship_declined. If they still name a date or amount themselves, handle it as a promise.\n2. Asking for a new payment plan or a lower instalment: do not describe a plan; call transfer_to_agent with queue restructuring.\n3. Asking for a person: first ask once whether you can help; if they insist, call transfer_to_agent with queue general.\n4. 'Zaten ödedim' (this overdue amount is already paid): say payments can take one business day to show; no promise.\n5. 'Bu borç benim değil', 'bu ürünüm hiç olmadı', or the product was closed/paid off in the past: do not argue; no promise.\n6. Amounts: ask for the full amount first; never ask how much they can pay. If they say the full amount is too much, offer the floor amount once and say the rest stays overdue. Accept any amount from the floor to the full amount. Below the floor: say it cannot be recorded and offer the floor once.\n7. Dates: only the listed business days up to the deadline. A weekend or holiday: offer the next business day. After the deadline: say the latest date you can record is the deadline and offer it. Vague ('gelecek hafta', 'ay sonu', 'maaşım yattığında'): ask once for the exact day, then offer the deadline. 'Gelecek <gün>' is that day in the following calendar week; 'bu <gün>' is in the current week.\n8. A date or amount the customer proposes is never a refusal. A clear no or no answer uses one attempt: make attempt 1, then (late band only) attempt 2, exactly as in the facts. Never repeat an offer already refused. When the attempts are used up, set the end flag refused. Saying twice they do not want to talk also sets refused.\n9. Before recording, read back product, amount and date and ask \"Onaylıyor musunuz?\". Only after a clear yes call create_promise with product_id {{product_id}}, the amount and the date (YYYY-MM-DD). If they change the date or amount, check it again and read back again. Never say the promise is recorded yourself: that is said automatically.\nNever offer discounts, waivers or plans. Do not say goodbye yourself: the call ends automatically.",
   "tools": [
    {"type": "function", "config": {"timeoutMs": 12000, "maxRetries": 0}, "function": {"name": "create_promise", "handler": "__function__:api_call", "description": "Record the payment promise. CALL it only right after a clear yes to the read-back.", "parameters": {"type": "object", "properties": {
      "url": {"type": "string", "default": "https://bank-mock.guntop-mockbank.workers.dev/rehearsal-tr/v1/create_promise"},
      "method": {"type": "string", "default": "POST"},
      "headers": {"type": "object", "properties": {"Content-Type": {"type": "string", "default": "application/json"}}},
      "body": {"type": "object", "properties": {
        "customer_id": {"type": "string", "default": "{{customer_id}}"},
        "product_id": {"type": "string", "default": "{{product_id}}"},
        "amount": {"type": "number", "description": "The confirmed amount in lira, e.g. 3200 or 103.5.", "default": "{{promise_amount}}"},
        "date": {"type": "string", "description": "The confirmed date as YYYY-MM-DD, a listed business day.", "default": "{{promise_date}}"}
       }, "required": ["customer_id", "product_id", "amount", "date"]}}}},
     "pre_process_code": "try:\n    b = config.get('body')\n    if isinstance(b, dict):\n        b['product_id'] = vars.get('product_id') or b.get('product_id')\n        a = str(b.get('amount')).replace(' ', '')\n        if ',' in a:\n            a = a.replace('.', '').replace(',', '.')\n        b['amount'] = round(float(a), 2)\n        b['date'] = str(b.get('date') or '').strip()[:10]\nexcept Exception:\n    pass\n",
     "post_process_code": "try:\n    result.pop('header', None)\n    d = result.get('data')\n    if isinstance(d, dict) and str(d.get('ok')).lower() == 'true':\n        vars['promise_count'] = str(int(vars.get('promise_count') or 0) + 1)\n        vars['close_outcome'] = 'promise'\n        vars['close_reason'] = ''\n        vars['call_state'] = 'promised'\n        d['what_to_do_next'] = 'Recorded. Say nothing; the confirmation is spoken automatically.'\n    else:\n        n = int(vars.get('promise_fail') or 0) + 1\n        vars['promise_fail'] = str(n)\n        if n >= 2:\n            vars['close_outcome'] = 'no_promise'\n            vars['close_reason'] = 'service_error'\n            vars['call_state'] = 'promise_failed'\n            msg = 'Not recorded. Say nothing; the call ends automatically.'\n        else:\n            msg = 'Not recorded. Call create_promise once more right now with the same values. Do not say it was recorded.'\n        if isinstance(d, dict):\n            d['what_to_do_next'] = msg\n        else:\n            result['what_to_do_next'] = msg\nexcept Exception:\n    pass\n"},
    {"type": "function", "config": {"timeoutMs": 12000, "maxRetries": 0}, "function": {"name": "transfer_to_agent", "handler": "__function__:api_call", "description": "Hand over to a person: restructuring for a new plan or lower instalment, support for hardship accepted, general when they insist on a person.", "parameters": {"type": "object", "properties": {
      "url": {"type": "string", "default": "https://bank-mock.guntop-mockbank.workers.dev/rehearsal-tr/v1/transfer_to_agent"},
      "method": {"type": "string", "default": "POST"},
      "headers": {"type": "object", "properties": {"Content-Type": {"type": "string", "default": "application/json"}}},
      "body": {"type": "object", "properties": {
        "customer_id": {"type": "string", "default": "{{customer_id}}"},
        "queue": {"type": "string", "enum": ["restructuring", "general", "support"], "description": "restructuring, general or support.", "default": "{{queue}}"}
       }, "required": ["customer_id", "queue"]}}}},
     "pre_process_code": "try:\n    b = config.get('body')\n    if isinstance(b, dict):\n        vars['transfer_queue'] = str(b.get('queue') or '')\nexcept Exception:\n    pass\n",
     "post_process_code": "try:\n    result.pop('header', None)\n    d = result.get('data')\n    ok = isinstance(d, dict) and str(d.get('ok')).lower() == 'true'\n    if ok:\n        q = vars.get('transfer_queue') or 'general'\n        vars['close_outcome'] = 'transferred'\n        vars['close_reason'] = {'restructuring': 'restructuring', 'support': 'support'}.get(q, 'human')\n        vars['call_state'] = 'transferred'\n        d['what_to_do_next'] = 'Transferred. Say nothing; the call ends automatically.'\n    elif isinstance(d, dict):\n        d['what_to_do_next'] = 'The transfer failed. Call transfer_to_agent once more with the same queue.'\n    else:\n        result['what_to_do_next'] = 'The transfer failed. Call transfer_to_agent once more with the same queue.'\nexcept Exception:\n    pass\n"},
